OL,3,GNEWSAFringe festival mixing art with a
OL,4,Ahigh street cuppa
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of a fringe arts festival
OL,7,Fsaid they hope it helps bridge a
OL,8,Fmuch-needed gap between residents and
OL,9,Fthe cultural experiences they can have
OL,10,Fin their city.
OL,12,FHannah Taylor-Salter, joint organiser
OL,13,Fof Fringe Arts Wolverhampton, which is
OL,14,Fon from 27 to 29 November, said there
OL,15,Fwas a concerted effort to reconnect
OL,16,Fpeople with the arts.
OL,18,FWolverhampton was added to the Arts
OL,19,FCouncil England's list of "Culture
OL,20,FPriority Places" in May, highlighting
OL,21,Flow cultural engagement amid the need
OL,22,Ffor investment.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
