OL,3,GNEWSAFringe festival mixing art with a
OL,4,Ahigh street cuppa
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's taking creativity out into public
OL,7,Fspaces or heritage spaces that people
OL,8,Fwould visit anyway, like shopping
OL,9,Fcentres and churches, arts venues and
OL,10,Fpubs and bars," she said.
